    {
        "content": "<p><code>opencode</code> claims the fix will be:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Diff\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"gh\">diff --git a/src/Lean/Server/Completion/CompletionCollectors.lean b/src/Lean/Server/Completion/CompletionCollectors.lean</span>\n<span class=\"gh\">index 2382a8f286..821c566ca5 100644</span>\n<span class=\"gd\">--- a/src/Lean/Server/Completion/CompletionCollectors.lean</span>\n<span class=\"gi\">+++ b/src/Lean/Server/Completion/CompletionCollectors.lean</span>\n<span class=\"gu\">@@ -105,7 +105,10 @@ section Utils</span>\n<span class=\"w\"> </span>    match privateToUserName? declName with\n<span class=\"w\"> </span>    | none =&gt; return declName\n<span class=\"w\"> </span>    | some userName =&gt;\n<span class=\"gd\">-      if mkPrivateName (← getEnv) userName == declName then</span>\n<span class=\"gi\">+      let env ← getEnv</span>\n<span class=\"gi\">+      if env.isImportedConst declName then</span>\n<span class=\"gi\">+        return userName</span>\n<span class=\"gi\">+      else if mkPrivateName env userName == declName then</span>\n<span class=\"w\"> </span>        return userName\n<span class=\"w\"> </span>      else\n<span class=\"w\"> </span>        return none\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>if you care to try it out and see if that does it, but I don't have the spoons to dedicate personally -- I think <span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"221921\">Marc Huisinga</span>  is a bit busy but when he gets a minute I'm sure he'll tell us whether the existing behavior is intentional for some reason.</p>",
        "id": 577623426,
        "sender_full_name": "Julian Berman",
        "timestamp": 1772756719
    }
